            lines: ['“Use of deadly force authorized.” “Against whom?” “The authorization does not say.”','“The gate is open.” “The gate is always open.” “Then what is the guard for?” “The guard is for the gate.”','“Runway thirty-three.” “There is no thirty-three.” “There is no runway. Both are lit.”','“The tower is manned.” “By whom?” “By the tower.”','“The mast is for the beacon.” “The beacon is on the tower.” “Then the mast is for the mast.”','“The crater is not on the plan.” “What made it?” “The plan.”'],
